      "index": "b058",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1221133906,
      "version": 1282,
      "versionNonce": 869887711,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788869611011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Questions:\n\n1. what info we need via client onboarding?\n2. what legal agreements do we have to provide?\n3. for some companies we have to register with them also as a vendor,\nhow will be do that?\n4. can you suggest me good flow. tell me if this is fine\n5. what about services we provided, how will be provide them perfectly,\nlike the flow subscription prices, business models (how do we update\nthem?) you cannot update or add a random business model, there should\nbe some criteria.\n6. Do we need onboarding request. \n7. list of free trails, list of onboarding clients. \n8. how do you manage them both, clients who are already onboarded and\nclients with free trail.\n9. list of invoices, Payment Reconciliation\n10. I need full flow. can you please give me full information.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "--bJFHI47vIqNqFhxv8Tw",
      "originalText": "Questions:\n\n1. what info we need via client onboarding?\n2. what legal agreements do we have to provide?\n3. for some companies we have to register with them also as a vendor, how will be do that?\n4. can you suggest me good flow. tell me if this is fine\n5. what about services we provided, how will be provide them perfectly, like the flow subscription prices, business models (how do we update them?) you cannot update or add a random business model, there should be some criteria.\n6. Do we need onboarding request. \n7. list of free trails, list of onboarding clients. \n8. how do you manage them both, clients who are already onboarded and clients with free trail.\n9. list of invoices, Payment Reconciliation\n10. I need full flow. can you please give me full information.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
