      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788869252437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Depot code is on the\nreport,\nparsed and validated.\nA container\nmust already be\n'Depot In' at that\ndepot before it can\ngo 'Depot Out' —\nthen it is allocated to\nthe booking.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
