      "containerId": "ASt1lcWkA1w8gA9vKBHcC",
      "originalText": "Depot code is on the report,\nparsed and validated. A container\nmust already be 'Depot In' at that\ndepot before it can go 'Depot Out' —\nthen it is allocated to the booking.",
