      "updated": 1799999999999,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "All negotiation happens in the Customer Portal (never raw email). Customer gets only a notification mail:\n\"New message on your booking — log in to view.\" Portal account is auto-created on Sales's first reply;\nthat mail doubles as the invite.",
